<h2 id="control">5. How to block them</h2>
<p>
  Any content-blocking extension, or a browser in strict tracking-protection mode, will stop these requests. The site is
  built to stay readable without them: text, layout and navigation are served entirely from this domain. What you lose
  is the icon glyphs, the custom typeface, and the GitHub activity graph.
</p>
